    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Sorry for being late. Your Majesty.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I will guide you to use support roles like me in Concept Clash.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Please brace yourself. We're going to attack that black one again.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...Again?
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c56d01f7147e2fe3bb19ffecd321267b, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: WAIT, WHAT?!
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Noz calmly explains how Support characters work and how they can assist
        the active unit.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: As a Support, I can provide assistance without needing to remain on the
        battlefield. You can switch between your party members to make use of their
        abilities.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c56d01f7147e2fe3bb19ffecd321267b, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I THOUGHT YOU WERE HERE TO HELP ME?!
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I'm afraid not.
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ROUND TWO!!! LET'S GOOOOOO!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      effect: 0
